
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#172554">
  <title>Installation Android | NeTubeX</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f3f5f9;
      color: #172554;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 430px;
      background: white;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 30px 22px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 35px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 30px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: #172554;
    }

    .logo span {
      color: #e67e22;
    }

    .subtitle {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .app-icon {
      width: 90px;
      height: 90px;
      border-radius: 22px;
      background: #172554;
      color: white;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 38px;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 23px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .description {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .download-btn {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 17px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #e67e22;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 16px;
      transition: .2s;
    }

    .download-btn:active {
      transform: scale(.98);
    }

    .notice {
      background: #f1f5f9;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 15px;
      margin-top: 22px;
      text-align: left;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #475569;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .notice strong {
      color: #172554;
    }

    .footer {
      margin-top: 25px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #94a3b8;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <main class="container">

    <div class="logo">NeTube<span>X</span></div>
    <div class="subtitle">Installation officielle Android</div>

    <div class="app-icon">N</div>

    <h1>Installer l'application</h1>

    <p class="description">
      Téléchargez le fichier d'installation Android
      et profitez de votre application NeTubeX.
    </p>

    <a
      class="download-btn"
      href="/downloads/ntx-8fK29xPq7Lm4VzR6.apk"
      download
    >
      ↓ Télécharger l'application
    </a>

    <div class="notice">
      <strong>Comment installer ?</strong><br>
      1. Cliquez sur le bouton de téléchargement.<br>
      2. Attendez la fin du téléchargement.<br>
      3. Ouvrez le fichier APK téléchargé.<br>
      4. Autorisez l'installation si Android le demande.<br>
      5. Confirmez en appuyant sur Installer.
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      NeTubeX SARL · ÉDUQUER • INNOVER • TRANSFORMER
    </div>

  </main>

</body>
</html>
